
# Majrusz's Cards

>  Like Uno But There's 3 Of Them

---
Purchased from &eWandering Traders&r, these cards can be used to modify your &1Majrusz's Accessories&r &6by crafting them together&r. 

the &bReverse Card&r is a Card that negates the efficiency bonus of any accessory. 

the &bGambling Card&r is a Card that redraws efficiency bonus of any accessory based on the last efficiency range. 

the &bRemoval Card&r is a Card that returns all &bBoosters&r applied to any accessory. 
            